 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
+- Transfers (`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer`, for moves between group companies):
+  - Only an org admin of the user's current organization may transfer users. A caller in another organization (or a `{orgID}` that is not the caller's) → 404; a caller who is not an org admin → 403.
+  - The target user must be in `{orgID}`, otherwise → 404.
+  - `toOrgId` must be a known organization → 400. Transferring to the same organization → 409.
+  - The user loses their memberships in the old organization and is unassigned from every task they held. Org admin rights are not carried over.
 
